  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You train and empower your dracoleum pathways to make your breath weapon more devastating. Your @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.ancestries.4fi4ZHm5YpY3s4zw]{Draichsar Breath} doubles its range, to a @Template[line|distance:60] or a </span><span>@Template[cone|distance:30]</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">, and its damage die increases to d6s instead of d4s. On a critical failure on a saving throw, you apply the breath weapon's critical weapon specialization effect to the creature. If your damage type is vitality or void, you add 2d6 persistent damage of that type on a critical failure.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Special</span></span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"> If you have the @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.ancestries.ApfqdfBZRKPAMFHc]{Dracoleum Glob} feat, its area also is doubled to a @Template[burst|distance:20].</span></p>"
    },
